        <div class="faq-question">What is Qripty?<div class="faq-chevron">▾</div></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Qripty is a quantum readiness platform purpose-built for fintech. It discovers cryptographic algorithms in use across your API estate, generates a cryptographic bill of materials (CBOM), assesses risk, and deploys hybrid post-quantum protection — without application code changes or moving data outside your infrastructure.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" tabindex="0">
        <div class="faq-question">Does it require code changes?<div class="faq-chevron">▾</div></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">No. Qripty deploys at the API gateway or network layer, entirely outside your application codebase. The entire cryptographic upgrade happens transparently in the infrastructure layer.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" tabindex="0">
        <div class="faq-question">Does Qripty access our data or API payloads?<div class="faq-chevron">▾</div></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Never. Qripty operates exclusively at the header and metadata level. Payload content is never accessed, inspected, or transmitted — enforced by architecture, not just policy.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" tabindex="0">
        <div class="faq-question">How long does deployment take?<div class="faq-chevron">▾</div></div>
